{
  "summary": "This experiment tested an RNA-only model using the scvi_n200 encoder on multiprofile data with avgpool aggregation, building on the prior success of multiprofile and avgpool configurations. Validation accuracy of 0.6501 and F1 of 0.6275 suggest improved performance compared to the PCA-based baseline (config_002). Uncertainty remains about whether the RNA encoder choice is the primary driver of this improvement, as other factors like aggregation method or profile settings were not varied in this comparison."
}

